OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1785680281
OL,3,CTeenager dies after crash involving
OL,4,Cscrambler and lorry in Coalisland
OL,6,FA teenage boy has died after a crash
OL,7,Finvolving a scrambler and Scania lorry
OL,8,Fin Coalisland on Thursday evening.
OL,10,FDetective Inspector Stewart from the
OL,11,FPolice Service's Collision
OL,12,FInvestigation Unit said: "We received
OL,13,Fa report at approximately 8.15pm on
OL,14,FThursday evening, 30th July of a
OL,15,Fcollision involving a scrambler and
OL,16,FScania lorry in the Derryloughan Road
OL,17,Farea.
OL,26,@tD@ZOU
