OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1785680281
OL,3,CTeenager dies after crash involving
OL,4,Cscrambler and lorry in Coalisland
OL,6,F"Officers attended, alongside Northern
OL,7,FIreland Ambulance Service colleagues `
OL,8,Fand medical treatment was provided at
OL,9,Fthe scene.
OL,11,F"The 16-year-old, who has been named
OL,12,Fas Connor Magee Campbell from the
OL,13,FClonoe area, was taken onward to
OL,14,Fhospital where he sadly later died
OL,15,Ffrom his injuries.
OL,17,F"We would like to hear from witnesses
OL,18,For anyone who may have captured dash-
OL,19,Fcam or other footage of what happened,
OL,20,Fwhich could assist with our ongoing
OL,21,Fenquiries."
